{"id":307,"slug":"rashomon","title":"Rashomon","year":1950,"country":"Japan","duration":88,"spine":138,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/307-rashomon","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/21d6c647d6b04343bcb9a475c8bf161e/mCz7xlfXoonwsP48ZmChNuVOxzzHRT_large.jpg","description":"\nA riveting psychological thriller that investigates the nature of truth and the meaning of justice, Rashomon is widely considered one of the greatest films ever made. Four people give different accounts of a man’s murder and the rape of his wife, which director Akira Kurosawa presents with striking imagery and an ingenious use of flashbacks. This eloquent masterwork and international sensation revolutionized film language and introduced Japanese cinema—and a commanding new star by the name of Toshiro Mifune—to the Western world.\nRashomon was restored by the Academy Film Archive, the National Film Center of the National Museum of Modern Art, Tokyo, and Kadokawa Pictures, Inc. Funding provided by Kadokawa Culture Promotion Foundation and The Film Foundation.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Akira Kurosawa","slug":"akira-kurosawa"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Toshiro Mifune","role":"The bandit","slug":"toshiro-mifune"},{"actor":"Machiko Kyo","role":"The woman","slug":"machiko-kyo"},{"actor":"Masayuki Mori","role":"The man","slug":"masayuki-mori"},{"actor":"Takashi Shimura","role":"The woodcutter","slug":"takashi-shimura"},{"actor":"Minoru Chiaki","role":"The priest","slug":"minoru-chiaki"},{"actor":"Kichijiro Ueda","role":"The commoner","slug":"kichijiro-ueda"},{"actor":"Fumiko Honma","role":"The medium","slug":"fumiko-honma"},{"actor":"Daisuke Kato","role":"The policeman","slug":"daisuke-kato"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Akira Kurosawa","slug":"akira-kurosawa"},{"role":"Executive producer","person":"Masaichi Nagata","slug":null},{"role":"Producer","person":"Jingo Minoura","slug":null},{"role":"Scenario","person":"Akira Kurosawa","slug":"akira-kurosawa"},{"role":"Scenario","person":"Shinobu Hashimoto","slug":null},{"role":"Based on two stories by","person":"Ryunosuke Akutagawa","slug":null},{"role":"Photography","person":"Kazuo Miyagawa","slug":null},{"role":"Art director","person":"So Matsuyama","slug":null},{"role":"Music","person":"Fumio Hayasaka","slug":null},{"role":"Lighting","person":"Kenichi Okamoto","slug":null}],"pickedBy":[{"session":884,"title":"Nick Offerman’s Closet Picks","date":"2025-09-15","video":"https://vimeo.com/1132551845","celebs":[{"id":81,"name":"Nick Offerman"}]},{"session":631,"title":"Paul Giamatti’s Closet Picks","date":"2024-02-06","video":"https://vimeo.com/915252794","celebs":[{"id":228,"name":"Paul Giamatti"}]},{"session":838,"title":"François Girard’s Closet Picks","date":"2023-04-01","video":"https://vimeo.com/1095037634","celebs":[{"id":286,"name":"François Girard"}]},{"session":519,"title":"Elegance Bratton’s Closet Picks","date":"2022-10-21","video":"https://vimeo.com/787653697","celebs":[{"id":302,"name":"Elegance Bratton"}]},{"session":470,"title":"Barry Jenkins’s  Closet Picks","date":"2016-09-24","video":"https://vimeo.com/769945053","celebs":[{"id":369,"name":"Barry Jenkins’s  Closet Picks"}]}],"related":[940,863,165],"setFilms":[],"inSets":[]}